<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HOLLYWOOD | The History of Cinema</title>
    <script type="text/javascript">
    (function(c,l,a,r,i,t,y){
        c[a]=c[a]||function(){(c[a].q=c[a].q||[]).push(arguments)};
        t=l.createElement(r);t.async=1;t.src="https://www.clarity.ms/tag/"+i;
        y=l.getElementsByTagName(r)[0];y.parentNode.insertBefore(t,y);
    })(window, document, "clarity", "script", "<%= clarity %>");
</script>
    <style>
        /* ===== RESET & VARIABLES ===== */
        *, *::before, *::after {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --hollywood-gold: #D4AF37;
            --hollywood-dark: #050505;
            --hollywood-black: #000000;
            --hollywood-silver: #E5E4E2;
            --hollywood-red: #8a0b0b;
            --card-bg: #111111;
            --text-body: #cfcfcf;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--hollywood-dark);
            color: var(--hollywood-silver);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4 {
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--white);
        }

        h1, h2 {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif; /* Classic movie poster feel */
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        /* ===== NAVBAR ===== */
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-inner {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            height: 70px;
        }

        .nav-logo {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, var(--hollywood-gold));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #888;
            position: relative;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--hollywood-gold);
        }

        .hamburger {
            display: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            cursor: pointer;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .hamburger span {
            width: 25px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--hollywood-gold);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        /* ===== HERO SECTION ===== */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15) 0%, transparent 60%),
                linear-gradient(to bottom, #000, #111);
            padding: 0 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Spotlight Effect */
        .hero::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: 20%;
            width: 20%;
            height: 200%;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.03), transparent);
            transform: rotate(15deg);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            max-width: 800px;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            color: var(--hollywood-gold);
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: block;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #999;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .btn-gold {
            padding: 15px 40px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--hollywood-gold);
            color: var(--hollywood-gold);
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-gold:hover {
            background: var(--hollywood-gold);
            color: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4);
        }

        /* ===== STATS STRIP ===== */
        .stats-strip {
            background: #0a0a0a;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
        }

        .stats-grid {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-item h3 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--hollywood-gold);
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .stat-item p {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #666;
        }

        /* ===== GENERAL SECTIONS ===== */
        section {
            padding: 100px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 70px;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .section-header .divider {
            width: 60px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--hollywood-gold);
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* ===== TIMELINE HISTORY ===== */
        .history-section {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0a0a, #000);
        }

        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .timeline::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            width: 1px;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--hollywood-gold), transparent);
            transform: translateX(-50%);
        }

        .timeline-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            padding-right: 40px;
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
            opacity: 0; /* Animation start state */
            transform: translateY(30px);
            transition: all 0.8s ease;
        }

        .timeline-item.visible {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
            flex-direction: row-reverse;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            padding-right: 0;
            padding-left: 40px;
        }

        .timeline-dot {
            position: absolute;
            right: -6px;
            top: 0;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            background: var(--hollywood-gold);
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--hollywood-gold);
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) .timeline-dot {
            right: auto;
            left: -6px;
        }

        .timeline-content {
            width: 45%;
            background: #111;
            padding: 25px;
            border: 1px solid #222;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .timeline-year {
            color: var(--hollywood-gold);
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }

        .timeline-content h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .timeline-content p {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* ===== LEGENDS GRID ===== */
        .legends-section {
            background: #050505;
        }

        .legends-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .legend-card {
            background: #0f0f0f;
            border: 1px solid #222;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .legend-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--hollywood-gold);
        }

        .icon-box {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            filter: grayscale(100%);
            transition: filter 0.3s;
        }

        .legend-card:hover .icon-box {
            filter: grayscale(0%);
        }

        .legend-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .legend-role {
            color: var(--hollywood-gold);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: block;
        }

        .legend-card p {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        /* ===== BLOCKBUSTERS/HITS ===== */
        .hits-section {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #050505, #0a0a0a);
        }

        .hits-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .hit-card {
            background: #111;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #222;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .hit-card:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            border-color: #444;
        }

        .hit-image {
            height: 200px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 4rem;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, #222, #000);
        }

        .hit-info {
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .hit-meta {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #666;
        }

        .hit-rating {
            color: var(--hollywood-gold);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .hit-info h3 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .hit-info p {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        /* QUOTE */
        .quote-section {
            padding: 80px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23222222' fill-opacity='0.4'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
        }

        .quote-container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .quote-text {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #ddd;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .quote-author {
            color: var(--hollywood-gold);
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer {
            background: #000;
            padding: 60px 20px 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #222;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .footer-col h4 {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .copyright {
            color: #444;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #111;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }

        /* UTILITIES */
        .back-to-top {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            background: var(--hollywood-gold);
            color: #000;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            cursor: pointer;
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            transition: 0.3s;
            font-weight: bold;
            border: none;
            z-index: 999;
        }

        .back-to-top.show {
            opacity: 1;
            visibility: visible;
        }

        /* RESPONSIVE */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-links {
                position: fixed;
                top: 70px;
                left: 0;
                width: 100%;
                background: #000;
                flex-direction: column;
                padding: 20px 0;
                transform: translateY(-150%);
                transition: transform 0.4s ease;
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hollywood-gold);
            }
            
            .nav-links.active {
                transform: translateY(0);
            }

            .hamburger { display: flex; }
            
            .timeline::before { left: 20px; }
            .timeline-item, .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
                justify-content: flex-start;
                padding-left: 50px;
                padding-right: 0;
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            
            .timeline-dot, .timeline-item:nth-child(even) .timeline-dot {
                left: 14px;
                right: auto;
            }
            
            .timeline-content { width: 100%; }
            
            .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <nav id="navbar">
        <div class="nav-inner">
            <a href="#" class="nav-logo">HOLLYWOOD</a>
            <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#history">The Past</a></li>
                <li><a href="#legends">Legends</a></li>
                <li><a href="#hits">The Hits</a></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="hamburger" id="hamburger">
                <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <span class="hero-subtitle">EST. 1920 • LOS ANGELES</span>
            <h1>Dreams,<br>Cinema & Legacy</h1>
            <p>A tribute to the greatest storytelling engine the world has ever known.</p>
            <a href="#history" class="btn-gold">Enter the Theater</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- STATS -->
    <div class="stats-strip">
        <div class="stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-item fade-in">
                <h3>100+</h3>
                <p>Years of Film</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item fade-in">
                <h3>$20B+</h3>
                <p>Annual Box Office</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item fade-in">
                <h3>96</h3>
                <p>Years of Oscars</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item fade-in">
                <h3>∞</h3>
                <p>Stories Told</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HISTORY TIMELINE -->
    <section class="history-section" id="history">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span style="color:var(--hollywood-gold); letter-spacing:2px; font-size:0.8rem;">REVOLUTION</span>
                <h2>The Evolution of Cinema</h2>
                <div class="divider"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="timeline">
                <div class="timeline-item fade-in">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year">1927</div>
                        <h3>The Jazz Singer</h3>
                        <p>Released by Warner Bros., this film marks the end of the silent era. Audiences hear Al Jolson sing and speak, forever changing the industry forever.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item fade-in">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year">1939</div>
                        <h3>The Golden Age Peak</h3>
                        <p>Considered the greatest year in cinema history. Releases include "The Wizard of Oz", "Gone with the Wind", and "Casablanca".</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item fade-in">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year">1975</div>
                        <h3>Jaws & The Blockbuster</h3>
                        <p>Steven Spielberg changes distribution models with wide releases and heavy marketing. The summer blockbuster is born.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item fade-in">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year">1999</div>
                        <h3>The Digital Shift</h3>
                        <p>Starship Troopers becomes the first digital-only feature presentation, signaling the eventual demise of celluloid film.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item fade-in">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <div class="timeline-year">2024-26</div>
                        <h3>The Streaming Era</h3>
                        <p>Theatrical windows shrink, streaming wars intensify, and Artificial Intelligence enters the writing room, sparking new debates about creativity.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LEGENDS -->
    <section class="legends-section" id="legends">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span style="color:var(--hollywood-gold); letter-spacing:2px; font-size:0.8rem;">ICONIC FIGURES</span>
                <h2>Masters of the Craft</h2>
                <div class="divider"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="legends-grid">
                <!-- Card 1 -->
                <div class="legend-card fade-in">
                    <div class="icon-box">🎭</div>
                    <h3>Charlie Chaplin</h3>
                    <span class="legend-role">Director & Actor</span>
                    <p>The master of physical comedy whose character "The Tramp" became a global symbol of humanity.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 2 -->
                <div class="legend-card fade-in">
                    <div class="icon-box">👠</div>
                    <h3>Marilyn Monroe</h3>
                    <span class="legend-role">Actress</span>
                    <p>The ultimate blonde bombshell. An actress who transcended her image to touch hearts worldwide.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 3 -->
                <div class="legend-card fade-in">
                    <div class="icon-box">🎬</div>
                    <h3>Alfred Hitchcock</h3>
                    <span class="legend-role">The Master of Suspense</span>
                    <p>Redefining thriller cinema with psychological mind games in films like Psycho and Vertigo.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 4 -->
                <div class="legend-card fade-in">
                    <div class="icon-box">🤠</div>
                    <h3>Clint Eastwood</h3>
                    <span class="legend-role">Actor & Director</span>
                    <p>The Man With No Name. A legend who ruled the western genre and continued directing into his 90s.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 5 -->
                <div class="legend-card fade-in">
                    <div class="icon-box">🪐</div>
                    <h3>Stanley Kubrick</h3>
                    <span class="legend-role">Visionary Director</span>
                    <p>The perfectionist behind 2001: A Space Odyssey. He set the standard for technical filmmaking.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 6 -->
                <div class="legend-card fade-in">
                    <div class="icon-box">🍿</div>
                    <h3>Steven Spielberg</h3>
                    <span class="legend-role">The Crowd Pleaser</span>
                    <p>From Jaws to Schindler's List, the most successful director in box office history.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- BIGGEST HITS -->
    <section class="hits-section" id="hits">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span style="color:var(--hollywood-gold); letter-spacing:2px; font-size:0.8rem;">BOX OFFICE GODS</span>
                <h2>Defining Masterpieces</h2>
                <div class="divider"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="hits-grid">
                <!-- Movie 1 -->
                <div class="hit-card fade-in">
                    <div class="hit-image">🌊</div>
                    <div class="hit-info">
                        <div class="hit-meta">
                            <span>1997</span>
                            <span class="hit-rating">⭐ 7.9</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Titanic</h3>
                        <p>The love story that stopped the world. James Cameron's epic romance held the box office record for over a decade.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Movie 2 -->
                <div class="hit-card fade-in">
                    <div class="hit-image">💍</div>
                    <div class="hit-info">
                        <div class="hit-meta">
                            <span>2003</span>
                            <span class="hit-rating">⭐ 9.0</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3>The Lord of the Rings: Return of the King</h3>
                        <p>Peter Jackson's fantasy trilogy concluded in triumph, winning all 11 Oscars it was nominated for.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Movie 3 -->
                <div class="hit-card fade-in">
                    <div class="hit-image">🦖</div>
                    <div class="hit-info">
                        <div class="hit-meta">
                            <span>1993</span>
                            <span class="hit-rating">⭐ 8.2</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Jurassic Park</h3>
                        <p>Where practical effects met CGI magic. It created the modern visual effects industry instantly.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Movie 4 -->
                <div class="hit-card fade-in">
                    <div class="hit-image">🕶️</div>
                    <div class="hit-info">
                        <div class="hit-meta">
                            <span>1999</span>
                            <span class="hit-rating">⭐ 8.7</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3>The Matrix</h3>
                        <p>Changed action choreography and philosophy in sci-fi forever with "Bullet Time".</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                 <!-- Movie 5 -->
                 <div class="hit-card fade-in">
                    <div class="hit-image">🎨</div>
                    <div class="hit-info">
                        <div class="hit-meta">
                            <span>2024</span>
                            <span class="hit-rating">⭐ 8.6</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Dune: Part Two</h3>
                        <p>A return to the scale of epic sci-fi storytelling in IMAX theaters, dominating the late 2020s cinema landscape.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                 <!-- Movie 6 -->
                 <div class="hit-card fade-in">
                    <div class="hit-image">🔫</div>
                    <div class="hit-info">
                        <div class="hit-meta">
                            <span>1972</span>
                            <span class="hit-rating">⭐ 9.2</span>
                        </div>
